(214, 'PLACA ASUS INTEL Z390-E ROG STRIX GAMING DDR4', '14096', 'placa-asus-intel-z390-e-rog-strix-gaming-ddr4', '<h2>CPU</h2><p>Intel® Socket 11519th / 8th Gen Intel® Core™, Pentium® Gold and Celeron® Processors</p><p>Supports Intel® 14nm CPU</p><p>Supports Intel® Turbo Boost Technology 2.0</p><p>* The Intel® Turbo Boost Technology 2.0 support depends on the CPU types.</p><p>* Refer to <a href=\"http://www.asus.com/\">www.asus.com</a> for CPU support list</p><h2>Chipset</h2><p>Intel® Z390</p><h2>Memoria</h2><p>4 x DIMM, Max. 64GB, DDR4 4266(O.C.)/4133(O.C.)/4000(O.C.)/3866(O.C.)/3733(O.C.)/3600(O.C.)/3466(O.C.)/3400(O.C.)/3333(O.C.)/3300(O.C.)/3200(O.C.)/3000(O.C.)/2800(O.C.)/2666/2400/2133 MHz Non-ECC, Un-buffered Memory</p><p>Supports Intel® Extreme Memory Profile (XMP)</p><p>* Hyper DIMM support is subject to the physical characteristics of individual CPUs.</p><p>Dual Channel Memory Architecture</p><p>* Refer to <a href=\"http://www.asus.com/\">www.asus.com</a> for the Memory QVL (Qualified Vendors Lists).</p><h2>Gráficos</h2><p>- Supports DisplayPort with max. resolution 4096 x 2304 @ 60 Hz *1</p><p>- Supports HDMI with max. resolution 4096 x 2160 @ 30Hz</p><p>Integrated Graphics Processor- Intel® HD Graphics support</p><p>Supports Intel® InTru™ 3D, Quick Sync Video, Clear Video HD Technology, Insider™</p><p>Multi-VGA output support : HDMI/DisplayPort ports</p><h2>Soporte Multi GPU</h2><p>Supports NVIDIA® 2-Way SLI™ Technology</p><p>Supports AMD 3-Way CrossFireX™ Technology</p><h2>Slots de Expansión</h2><p>2 x PCIe 3.0/2.0 x16 (x16 or dual x8)</p><p>3 x PCIe 3.0/2.0 x1</p><p>1 x PCIe 3.0/2.0 x16 (max at x4 mode)</p><h2>Almacenamiento</h2><p>1 x M.2 Socket 3, with M key, type 2242/2260/2280 storage devices support (both SATA &amp; PCIE mode)*2</p><p>1 x M.2 Socket 3, with M key, type 2242/2260/2280/22110 storage devices support (PCIE 3.0 x 4 mode)</p><p><strong>Intel® Z390 Chipset :</strong></p><p>Support Raid 0, 1, 5, 10</p><p>Intel® Optane™ Memory Ready</p><p>6 x SATA 6Gb/s port(s)</p><h2>LAN</h2><p>Intel® I219V</p><p>Anti-surge LANGuard</p><p>ROG GameFirst Technology</p><h2>Datos de redes inlámbricas</h2><p>Intel® Wireless-AC 9560</p><p>Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac</p><p>Supports dual band frequency 2.4/5 GHz</p><p>Supports MU-MIMO</p><h2>Bluetooth</h2><p>Bluetooth® 5.0</p><h2>Audio</h2><p>ROG SupremeFX8-Channel High Definition Audio CODEC S1220A</p><p>- SupremeFX Shielding™ Technology</p><p>- Dual OP Amplifiers</p><p>- Impedance sense for front and rear headphone outputs</p><p>- Supports : Jack-detection, Multi-streaming, Front Panel Jack-retasking</p><p>- High quality120dBSNR stereo playback outputand113dBSNR recording input</p><p>- SupremeFX Shielding Technology</p><p>- Supports up to 32-Bit/192kHz playback *2</p><p>- Sonic Radar III</p><p>- Sonic Studio III + Sonic Studio Link</p><p><strong>Audio Feature :</strong></p><p>- Optical S/PDIF out port(s) at back panel</p><p>- Dedicated audio PCB layers: Separate layers for left and right channels to guard the quality of the sensitive audio signals</p><p>- Premium Japanese-made audio capacitors: Provide warm, natural and immersive sound with exceptional clarity and fidelity</p><h2>Puertos USB</h2><p>4 x USB 3.1 Gen 2 port(s) (3 x Type-A+1 x USB Type-CTM)</p><p>6 x USB 2.0 port(s) (2 at back panel, black, 4 at mid-board)</p><p><strong>Intel® Z390 Chipset :</strong></p><p>1 x USB 3.1 Gen 2 front panel connector port(s)</p><p>4 x USB 3.1 Gen 1 port(s) (2 at back panel, blue, 2 at mid-board)</p><h2>Caracteristicas Overclocking</h2><p><strong>ROG Exclusive Software</strong></p><p>- RAMCache III</p><p>- CPU-Z</p><p>- GameFirst V</p><h2>Caracteristicas Especiales</h2><p><strong>AI Overclocking</strong></p><p>- 3D Printing Friendly</p><p><strong>ASUS Optimem II：</strong></p><p><strong>OC Design - ASUS PRO Clock Technology</strong></p><p>- Full BCLK range for extreme overclocking performance</p><p>- 5-Way Optimization tuning key perfectly consolidates TPU Insight, EPU Guidance, DIGI+ VRM, Fan Expert 4, and Turbo App</p><p>- Aura Addressable Strip Header(s)</p><p>- MemOK! II</p><p><strong>Digi+VRM</strong></p><p><strong>M.2 Onboard(The latest transfer technologies with up to 32Gb/s data transfer speeds)</strong></p><p>- Aura Lighting Effects Synchronization with compatible ASUS ROG devices</p><p>- Pre-mounted I/O Shield</p><p>- ASUS NODE: hardware control interface</p><p><strong>Gaming Aesthetics :</strong></p><p>- AURA-RGB Lighting</p><p>- DRAM Overcurrent Protection</p><p><strong>5-Way Optimization by Dual Intelligent Processors 5</strong></p><p>- Improved DDR4 Stability</p><p><strong>AURA :</strong></p><p>- Aura Lighting Control</p><p>- Aura RGB Strip Headers</p><p><strong>ASUS Exclusive Features</strong> :</p><p>- AI Suite 3</p><p>- Ai Charger</p><p>- Armoury Crate</p><p><strong>ASUS EZ DIY :</strong></p><p>- ASUS CrashFree BIOS 3</p><p>- ASUS EZ Flash 3</p><p><strong>ASUS Q-Design :</strong></p><p>- ASUS Q-LED (CPU, DRAM, VGA, Boot Device LED)</p><p>- ASUS Q-Slot</p><p>- ASUS Q-DIMM</p><p><strong>DIY Friendly Design</strong></p><p>- Procool</p><p>- SafeSlot</p><p>- Digi+ VRM</p><p>- Highly Durable components</p><p>- ESD Guards</p><h2>Puertos I/O Traseros</h2><p>4 x USB 3.1 Gen 2 (3 x Type-A+1 x USB Type-CTM)</p><p>2 x USB 3.1 Gen 1</p><p>2 x USB 2.0</p><p>1 x ASUS Wi-Fi Module</p><p>1 x DisplayPort</p><p>1 x HDMI</p><p>1 x LAN (RJ45) port(s)</p><p>1 x Optical S/PDIF out</p><p>5 x Audio jack(s)</p><h2>Internal I/O</h2><p>1 x M.2_FAN connector</p><p>1 x System panel(s) (Chassis intrusion header is inbuilt)</p><p>1 x 5-pin EXT_FAN(Extension Fan) connector</p><p>1 x CPU OV</p><p>1 x AIO PUMP Header</p><p>1 x Aura Addressable Strip Header(s)</p><p>1 x USB 3.1 Gen 1(up to 5Gbps) connector(s) support(s) additional 2 USB 3.1 Gen 1 port(s)</p><p>1 x M.2 Socket 3 with M key, type 2242/2260/2280 storage devices support (SATA &amp; PCIE 3.0 x 4 mode)</p><p>1 x M.2 Socket 3 with M key, type 2242/2260/2280/22110 storage devices support (PCIE 3.0 x 4 mode)</p><p>1 x MemOK! II switch(es)</p><p>1 x 14-1 pin TPM connector</p><p>1 x USB 3.1 Gen 2 front panel connector</p><p>6 x SATA 6Gb/s connector(s)</p><p>1 x AAFP connector</p><p>2 x Chassis Fan connector(s)</p><p>1 x W_PUMP+ connector</p><p>1 x Thermal sensor connector(s)</p><p>1 x Node Connector(s)</p><p>2 x Aura RGB Strip Header(s)</p><p>2 x USB 2.0 connector(s) support(s) additional 4 USB 2.0 port(s)</p><p>1 x CPU Fan connector(s)</p><p>1 x CPU OPT Fan connector(s)</p><p>1 x 24-pin EATX Power connector(s)</p><p>1 x 8-pin ATX 12V Power connector(s)</p><p>1 x Clear CMOS jumper(s)</p><p>1 x COM port header</p><h2>Accessorios</h2><p>1 x Assistant Fans(40mm)</p><p>1 x screws for Assistant Fan(s)</p><p>1 x CABLE TIE BLACK</p><p>1 x ROG Door Hanger(s)</p><p>1 x SLI HB BRIDGE(2-WAY-M)</p><p>1 x ROG Strix stickers</p><p>1 x Extension Cable for RGB strips (80 cm)</p><p>1 x Extension cable for Addressable LED</p><p>1 x Thermistor cable(s)</p><p>User´s manual</p><p>4 x SATA 6Gb/s cable(s)</p><p>1 x M.2 Screw Package</p><p>1 x Supporting DVD</p><p>1 x ASUS 2T2R dual band Wi-Fi moving antennas (Wi-Fi 802.11a/b/g/n/ac compliant)</p><h2>BIOS</h2><p>1 x 128 Mb Flash ROM, UEFI AMI BIOS, PnP, DMI3.0, SM BIOS 3.1, ACPI 6.1</p><h2>Capacidad de gestión</h2><p>WOL , PXE</p><h2>Sistema Operativo</h2><p>Windows® 10 64-bit</p><h2>Factor de forma</h2><p>12 inch x 9.6 inch ( 30.5 cm x 24.4 cm )</p><p>ATX Form Factor</p>', '<ul><li>Socket LGA1151 para la 9ª/8ª - generación de procesadores Intel® Core™.</li><li>Aura Sync RGB: Sincroniza la iluminación RGB con una amplia gama de equipos para PC compatibles y tiras RGB direccionables</li><li>Enfriamiento: Dos disipadores M.2, cabezal para bomba de agua, cabezal para extensión de ventiladores y un ventilador MOS con soporte</li><li>5-Way Optimization: Ajuste automatizado para tu sistema, que proporciona overclock inteligente y perfiles de enfriamiento hechos a medida p', 1008.50, 1008.50, 1008.50, 1008.50, 9, 0.0, 0, NULL, 11, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-06 17:34:59', '2026-01-26 22:24:17', 1, NULL, NULL, 'motherboard', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'activo'),
