 10%~90% non-condensing<br>Storage Humidity: 5%~90% non-condensing</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '<h2>300Mbps Wireless N Gigabit VoIP GPON Router</h2><ul><li>A GPON modem with wireless AP and 2-port Switch</li><li>Compliant with the ITU-T G.984/G.988 GPON standards, XN020-G3 supports maximum data rates of up to 2.488Gbps downstream and 1.244Gbps upstream.</li><li>TR-069 protocol enables an operator to remotely configure and manage end-user devices.</li></ul>', 121.00, 121.00, 121.00, 121.00, 31, 0.0, 0, NULL, 64, 20, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-06 17:34:59', '2026-01-26 22:24:50', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'activo'),
