g>Procesador:</strong> Intel Core i5-12500H (hasta 4.5 GHz, 18 MB cache L3)</li><li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8 GB DDR4, 3200 MHz</li><li><strong>Almacenamiento:</strong> 512 GB SSD M.2 PCIe 4.0x4 NVMe</li><li><strong>Gráficos:</strong> Intel Iris Xe (integrados)</li><li><strong>Conectividad:</strong> Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, LAN 1Gbps</li><li><strong>Puertos:</strong></li><li>1 x USB 2.0</li><li>1 x U', 1598.00, 1582.56, 1582.56, 1582.56, 0, 0.0, 0, NULL, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-06 17:34:59', '2026-01-26 22:26:09', 1, NULL, NULL, 'processor', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'activo');
